sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
Declaring a variable is only half of the pattern; rules consume it with var().

**Worked example:**

```css
a {
  color: var(--color-accent);
}
```

**Line by line:** `a {` targets links. `color:` controls the text color. `var(--color-accent)` resolves the shared accent value. The closing brace ends the rule.

