sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
A spacing token can replace a repeated literal while preserving the layout behavior learned earlier.

**Worked example:**

```css
main {
  gap: var(--space-section);
}
```

**Line by line:** `main {` targets the existing layout container. `gap:` controls spacing between its children. `var(--space-section)` supplies the shared spacing value. The closing brace ends the rule.

